repository-code: 'https://github.com/FormExamples/form-examples/'
url: 'https://formexamples.com'
abstract: >-
  A spec-driven monorepo of medical and administrative forms, each published as
  a complete worked stack: a PostgreSQL schema that is the source of truth, four
  representations generated from it (XML with DTD, HL7 FHIR R5, Protocol
  Buffers, and OpenAPI 3.1), two front-end implementations (static HTML and
  SvelteKit) of a single-page questionnaire wizard with a deterministic scoring
  or grading engine, and a Rust JSON API (axum and Loco). Machine-checked drift
  detectors hold every generated artefact in agreement with its source. The
  forms are worked examples; none is clinically validated or approved for care.
keywords:
  - medical forms
  - clinical assessment
  - questionnaire
  - HL7 FHIR
